NOTICE — Laden OS credits and upstream attribution
==================================================

Laden OS is based on CachyOS and Arch Linux. It is not Arch Linux and it is
not CachyOS. "Based on" wording is intentional; do not use those projects'
trademarks to imply endorsement.

Upstream projects (non-exhaustive)
----------------------------------
Arch Linux
  https://archlinux.org/
  Individual packages keep their own licenses.

CachyOS
  https://cachyos.org/
  Kernel packaging, calamares packaging, update/kernel/scheduler tooling that
  Laden forks are based on. Respect CachyOS repository usage policy: do not
  point end-user pacman at CachyOS mirrors for a public distro release.

archiso (Arch Linux)
  GPL-3.0-or-later. Profile shape under profile/ follows releng templates.

Calamares
  https://calamares.io/ and https://github.com/CachyOS/cachyos-calamares
  GPL-3.0-or-later. laden-calamares is a rebuild/repackage; laden-calamares-config
  is Laden installer configuration (files currently carry SPDX GPL-3.0-or-later).

cachy-update / Arch-Update
  https://github.com/CachyOS/cachy-update
  GPL-3.0-or-later. Forked as laden-update. Original Arch-Update by Robin Candau.

scx-manager
  https://github.com/CachyOS/scx-manager
  GPL-3.0-or-later. Forked as laden-scheduler.

cachyos-kernel-manager / kernel-manager
  https://github.com/cachyos/kernel-manager
  GPL-3.0-or-later. Forked as laden-kernel-manager.

Linux kernel
  GPL-2.0-only (with syscall exception as documented by the kernel).
  linux-laden is built from CachyOS kernel sources/config under that license.

KDE Plasma / Breeze color scheme contributors
  LadenDark.colors retains SPDX LGPL-2.0-or-later and upstream copyright lines.

BlackArch (optional lab packages)
  Not bundled as a full catalogue in the published source tree. If used in an
  image, each package keeps its own license.

